      en: ["Founded in 1108 by Prince Sviatopolk II, grandson of Yaroslav the Wise", "The first monastery in Eastern Europe to have gold-plated domes", "Completely destroyed in 1934 and reconstructed between 1997 and 1999", "Archangel Michael is the official patron saint of the city of Kyiv", "The cathedral's rare blue color represents the heavens and purity", "Features a chime of 36 bells in its tower that plays daily melodies"],
