      en: ["The facade of the church bears the inscription 'Soli Deo Honor et Gloria'.", "Architect Jan de Witte was also the commander of the Kamianets-Podilskyi fortress.", "The monastery building now houses the Lviv Museum of Religious History.", "The church's elliptical floor plan is a rare feature in regional Baroque architecture.", "The interior contains a notable funeral monument for Countess Dunin-Borkowska by Antonio Canova.", "The bell tower standing next to the church was added much later, in 1865."],
      es: ["Inicio de la construcción en 1749", "Arquitecto Jan de Witte", "Antiguo monasterio", "Estilo barroco tardío"],
      pt: ["Início da construção em 1749", "Arquiteto Jan de Witte", "Antigo mosteiro", "Estilo barroco tardio"],
